# Path of Darkness (ToAU 42), the Runic Seal with INSTANCE_ID 7701 (Nashmeira's Plea's id) at 116's finish with option
# 1: the char stays. As #instance, with the localvar step in place of its tick before 116's finish; the trace does
# not isolate INSTANCE_ID from the instance not being loaded (no tick), so a fake check pins the INSTANCE_ID test.
lists AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/_20m/onTrigger AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/onEventFinish/116
char zone=AlzadaalUnderseaRuins pos=125,-2,20 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PathOfDarkness current
keyitem NyzulIsleRoute
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
missionstatus Toau 1
trigger _20m
update 405 option=0
finish option=1073741824
localvar INSTANCE_ID 7701
finish option=1
tick 5000
